      },
      "message": "docs(agents): decisions go to a per-PR file in docs/decisions, gathered into RECOMMENDED.md at the cut\n\nEvery issue branch appending to the end of RECOMMENDED.md made each merge\nre-conflict every other open PR. One file per PR (docs/decisions/<issue>-\n<slug>.md) never collides; scripts/collect-decisions.ps1/.sh appends them\nin issue order under a vX.Y.Z heading at release step 2 and removes them.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
